msgstr "--mkfsoptions და --fsprofile ერთად ვერ გამოიყენება."

#: ../pykickstart/commands/logvol.py:799 ../pykickstart/commands/logvol.py:856
#: ../pykickstart/commands/partition.py:679 ../pykickstart/commands/raid.py:700
